* Tue Nov 17 2026 Michele Brami <info@michelebrami.it> 1.0.1-1
- A single unusable reply from the source no longer stops monitoring.
- A connection that was stopped for such a reply is tried again every hour.
- The patient page and tile offer Retry for that stop.
- The journal records the reason the adapter gave for the stop.
- Some comments in the source were corrected.

* Sun Nov 01 2026 Michele Brami <info@michelebrami.it> 1.0.0-1
- First public release.
